{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Meta 今日更新 <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/muse-from-meta/id6760173601\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iOS 版 Muse App</a>，加入 Apple Watch 支援，讓用戶可從手錶使用這個主動式 AI 代理。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"muse\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/muse-1024x538.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<h2>Apple Watch 操作 Muse</h2>\n<p>手錶版把 Muse 角色帶到 Apple Watch，用戶可向它輸入文字、向它口述文字，或直接通話；應用亦設有 Muse 複雜功能，供快速存取。</p>\n<p>Muse 是 Meta 的個人 AI 代理，可為用戶完成任務。它既有獨立應用程式，也內置於 Instagram、Facebook 及其他 Meta 應用。</p>\n<h2>Muse 角色置於當眼位置</h2>\n<p>Meta 設計代表 Muse 的雪人狀角色已受到歡迎，並置於 Apple Watch 介面的當眼位置。手錶應用程式的設計，與 Meta 在 9 月宣佈、定位為搭配裝置的 Muse Charm 相似。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 Apple Watch 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"551\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/applewatchs10.webp\" width=\"980\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.285088+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":350,"images":2,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T23:42:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T23:22:34.770901+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:04.709122+00:00","content_hash":"00cf366bfd2566176401020859f704e98169ce29b156d08081c05557b3a3a495","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}